---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help[start..].trim_end()"
---
Alternatives (do not combine forms):
  `required_choice`: `--required-choice` OR object options (`--required-choice-label`, `--required-choice-count`); required
  `optional_choice`: `--optional-choice` OR object options (`--optional-choice-label`, `--optional-choice-count`); optional
  `settings.outer_choice`: `--settings-outer-choice` OR object options (`--settings-outer-choice-choice`, `--settings-outer-choice-choice-label`, `--settings-outer-choice-choice-count`); required when `settings` is activated
  `settings.outer_choice.choice`: `--settings-outer-choice-choice` OR object options (`--settings-outer-choice-choice-label`, `--settings-outer-choice-choice-count`); required when the object form of `settings.outer_choice` is selected
  `settings.required_group.choice`: `--settings-required-group-choice` OR object options (`--settings-required-group-choice-label`, `--settings-required-group-choice-count`); required when `settings` is activated
  `settings.optional_group.choice`: `--settings-optional-group-choice` OR object options (`--settings-optional-group-choice-label`, `--settings-optional-group-choice-count`); required when `settings.optional_group` is activated
